{"title":"My podcast with Mitch Daniels","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/923131817/0/marginalrevolution~My-podcast-with-Mitch-Daniels.html","date":1755013632000,"content":"<p>Done with Liberty Fund, I very much enjoyed chatting with him.  Here is <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://thefutureofliberty.org/episode/tyler-cowen-on-ai-algorithms-immigration-and-forgotten-truths/\" target=\"_blank\">the link</a>.  Here is their episode summary:</p>\r\n<blockquote><p>Tyler Cowen joins Mitch Daniels to explore AI’s promise, economic threats from debt and regulation, and the need for bold, intelligent policy to secure economic growth, innovation, and individual liberty. Cowen discusses his views on immigration, COVID lockdowns and addresses societal fear of confronting rapid technological change.</p></blockquote>\r\n<p>A very down to earth conversation, in the best sense of that term.</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/08/my-podcast-with-mitch-daniels.html\">My podcast with Mitch Daniels</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/923131817/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/923131817/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/923131817/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/923131817/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/19/923131817/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/email20.p